{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁאָר","hw":"שְׁאָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאָר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:20\" href=\"/Ezra.7.20\">Ezr 7:20</a></sup> <strong>rest, remainder (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁאַר\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁאַר\", dir=\"rtl\">I. שׁאר</a>; Egyptian Aramaic n. <span dir=\"rtl\">שאר</span> Cooke<sup>203</sup>, vb. <span dir=\"rtl\">ישתאר</span> <em>be left</em> (outstanding) Cooke<sup>404</sup> = S-C<sup>L 9</sup>, Chr-Pal. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܐܪ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">Ezr 4:10</a> +, cstr. v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:9\" href=\"/Ezra.4.9\">9</a> +; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאָרָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">Dn 7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:19\" href=\"/Daniel.7.19\">19</a>;—of a thing, <em>remainder</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:18\" href=\"/Ezra.7.18\">Ezr 7:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:20\" href=\"/Ezra.7.20\">20</a>; of cities <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">4:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:17\" href=\"/Ezra.4.17\">17</a>, of persons v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:9\" href=\"/Ezra.4.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:17\" href=\"/Ezra.4.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:16\" href=\"/Ezra.6.16\">6:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:18\" href=\"/Daniel.2.18\">Dn 2:18</a>, of beasts <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:12\" href=\"/Daniel.7.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:19\" href=\"/Daniel.7.19\">19</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, שׁבב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁאֵלָה"}